{"id": "De6FhuAxNhB", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "The Ocean ignored Ram for 3 days… bad idea 🌊🏹 How did Ram cross the sea to Lanka? | Ramayan Part 11 of 12\n\n🤝 Ravana's own brother, Vibhishana, came over to Ram. The monkeys cried: \"He's a spy!\" But Ram said: \"I protect everyone who comes to me. Even if it were Ravana himself!\" (Valmiki Ramayana, Yuddha Kanda 17–18)\n🙏 To cross the sea, Ram prayed to the Ocean for 3 days. No answer. (Yuddha 21)\n⚡ So Ram got angry. His arrows churned the sea, and he raised the Brahmastra… (Yuddha 21–22)\n🌊 The Ocean himself rose up, hands joined: \"Forgive me, Ram!\" The arrow had to fly, so Ram shot it far to the north. (Yuddha 22)\n🪨 The Ocean said: \"Nala can build a bridge, and I'll hold it up!\" Nala and the monkeys built it, 100 yojanas long, in just 5 days. And the army marched to Lanka! (Yuddha 22)\n\n➡️ Next, the FINALE: Ram vs Ravana! Follow @therishikatha so you don't miss it!\n\n📚 Rishi Katha picture books tell our gods' stories for kids, in simple words and bright pictures → rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n💬 Comment JAI SHRI RAM 🙏\n🔖 Save this, and share it with someone who loves the Ramayan 🧡\n\n#ramayan #ramayana #ramsetu #shriram #vibhishana #nala #valmikiramayana #yuddhakanda #jaishriram #hanuman #sanatandharma #hindumythology #ramayanseries #rishikatha #mythologyforkids", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792910596, "like_count": 5265, "comment_count": 32, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1778461303422153a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 52.566, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMoVjixsuAtjrFJtbJBwt-lCtbNLPuPoQve6hxXbGSEe-0__Zio2SsfRz6SFfQsV_uwiPJxTAjkBoFPJ1U3C3648vqwiUPzN3dX9Hs.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Ado8lmtwKGyngGksfjQi-9R1ay60RsDVJ50Asv